# The starter application reads no environment variables.
#
# Add a variable here only when the application consumes it.
# - NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are inlined into the browser bundle at build time: never put a secret there.
# - Every other variable is read by the server at runtime and stays out of client artifacts.
# Copy this file to .env.local for local values; .env* files other than this one are not committed.
